<title>POLAND: Poland to announce DCS cellphone tender in May.</title>
<headline>Poland to announce DCS cellphone tender in May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will in early May announce a tender to operate a new digital mobile phone network using the DCS 1800 system, a telecommunications ministry official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;During the first few days of May the (DCS) tender should published in newspapers,&quot; Miroslaw Kopec, director of the legal department told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
